# foilboat W2 stub defaults
# 1 m RC flight-dev rig; minimal stub on top of rover.parm.
# Throttle on ch3, ground-steering/rudder on ch1 (inherited).
# Three extra surfaces wired as RC passthrough so the rig can be
# driven open-loop from the transmitter until AP_FoilControl lands.
#  SERVO5 = canard flap   (rcin5)
#  SERVO6 = main flap     (rcin6)
#  SERVO7 = rudder trim   (rcin7)
SERVO5_FUNCTION 55
SERVO5_MIN 1000
SERVO5_MAX 2000
SERVO6_FUNCTION 56
SERVO6_MIN 1000
SERVO6_MAX 2000
SERVO7_FUNCTION 57
SERVO7_MIN 1000
SERVO7_MAX 2000
